        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The old Woodman does not look up at once; he is listening to something in the roots. Then he blinks, slow as an owl.* Naldor, they call me here -- the Green, for the moss I sit in. Radagast had the teaching of me, what would stick. *He taps the ground.* The world breathes, you know. Slow. Leaf and root and beast, all turning together, and most folk never hear a note of it. You do. A little. I can see it sitting on you. Will you learn to hear the rest -- take up the Green Listening, and walk a while in it?"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 1,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": [
            {
              "__struct_id": 0,
              "Active": {
                "type": "resref",
                "value": ""
              },
              "Index": {
                "type": "dword",
                "value": 6
              },
              "IsChild": {
                "type": "byte",
                "value": 0
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Naldor turns a beetle off his knee, gently.* Listening, are you -- good; but a seedling hears little and a grown tree hears much. That is not impatience, it is arithmetic. Go into the wild lands and let them work on you. Come back when you have eight levels of the craft behind you, and I will trust you with something old."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 2,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": [
            {
              "__struct_id": 0,
              "Active": {
                "type": "resref",
                "value": ""
              },
              "Index": {
                "type": "dword",
                "value": 2
              },
              "IsChild": {
                "type": "byte",
                "value": 0
              }
            },
            {
              "__struct_id": 1,
              "Active": {
                "type": "resref",
                "value": ""
              },
              "Index": {
                "type": "dword",
                "value": 3
              },
              "IsChild": {
                "type": "byte",
                "value": 0
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He digs in the moss and comes up with a single dark seed, and holds it where the light can find it.* This came off a tree older than the Shire, and older than most of the names in it. It has been waiting a long while and does not mind waiting longer. *He offers it.* Carry it out into the wild lands. Listen as you go. Bring it back to me when you have grown into it, at the fifteenth level. Will you carry it?"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 3,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
        },
        "Comment": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Delay": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 4294967295
        },
        "Quest": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "RepliesList": {
          "type": "list",
          "value": [
            {
              "__struct_id": 0,
              "Active": {
                "type": "resref",
                "value": ""
              },
              "Index": {
                "type": "dword",
                "value": 6
              },
              "IsChild": {
                "type": "byte",
                "value": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "Script": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Naldor glances at the seed you carry and shakes his head, unhurried.* Not yet. It is not done with you and you are not done with it. Come back when you have fifteen levels behind you, and we shall hear what the wild has made of you."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 4,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
