        "Sound": {
          "type": "resref",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The staff is finished: pale mallorn, the dark seed grown fast into the head, the grain still creeping slowly around it.* There -- the Staff of the Breathing World. Nothing greater is woken in it yet; the Entmoot and the walking of the Old Forest are for a far greater day, when the hour comes round. You have walked the first of the Green Listening. Keep listening, friend."
          }
        }
      }
